# Johann, Apprentice Sorcerer: "If the top card of your library has an Adventure, you can cast the Adventure spell this way" (the ruling, CR 715.3a). Turn 3:
# the top card is Embereth Shieldbreaker, a creature card that is no instant or sorcery, but its Adventure Battle Display is a sorcery: Bot1 casts it from the
# top at Bot2's Mox Emerald and it is destroyed. The card goes to exile on an adventure, not to the graveyard. The creature itself ({1}{R}) is
# refused with Sapphire's and Ruby's mana in the pool: only the Adventure's characteristics make it an instant or sorcery spell (the ruling).
